{%- comment -%}
  lb-header-comment-template.liquid
  Version:      1.0.0
  Last updated: 2026-05-17

  PURPOSE:
    Reference template showing the standard header comment format
    used across all lb-* snippets in this theme.

  USAGE:
    Copy this header block to the top of any new lb-* snippet.
    Update: snippet filename, version, last updated date,
    purpose description, usage instructions, and dependencies.

  FORMAT:
    {%- comment -%}
      lb-[name].liquid
      Version:      X.Y.Z
      Last updated: YYYY-MM-DD
      Purpose:      One-line description
      Usage:        Where/how this is rendered
      Dependencies: Other snippets or objects required
    {%- endcomment -%}
{%- endcomment -%}
